 {
  "_id": "Namokar-Mahamantra",
  "_index": 40,
  "eBrief": "Namah Arihantanam : I bow to the Arihantas (the perfect human beings) <br />\nNamah Siddhhanam : I bow to the Siddhhas (liberated body less souls)<br />\nNamah Ayariyanam : I bow to the Acharyas (masters and the heads of congregations)<br />\nNamah Uvjhayanam : I bow to the Upadhyayas (spiritual teachers)<br />\nNamah Loye Savva Saahunam: I bow to all the Sadhus (spiritual practitioners) in the world<br />\nAiso Panch Namahkkaro : Worshiping all these five<br />\nSavva Paav Panasano : destroys all sins and obstacles<br />\nManglanancha Savvesim : Among all that is auspicious<br />\nPadhmam Havei Mangalam : this 'Navkar Mantra' is the foremost.",
  "eCtg": "Bhakti",
  "eName": "Namokar Mahamantra",
  "eNext": "Prabhu_Patit_Paavan",
  "ePrev": "Jinvani_Bhakti_AcharyaBhktiGyanodyaChhand",
